;==================================================
;弾幕勝負
;==================================================
;
@M_KOJO_EN_MESSAGE_COM_K93_DANMAKU(ARGS, 相手残機)
#DIM 相手残機
;全体の流れ
;①【戦闘前】→②ダイスロールとプレイヤー選択肢、ハンデをつけた場合は【ハンデ口上】→③対応スキルが発動した場合【スキル口上】→④被弾判定、キャラが被弾したなら【被弾口上】→
;どちらかの残機が0になっていなければ②に戻る→⑤【戦闘後口上】

;--------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------
IF LOCAL
SIF FLAG:口上色
	TRYCALLFORM M_KOJO_EN_COLOR_K{NO:TARGET}
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;小分岐
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;The larger the handicap, the more of a disadvantage the player is at
	;Negative numbers mean the player has an advantage
	;戦闘前
	LOCAL:9 = 0
	SIF K93_ISSWIM() ;small handicap for fighting in a place she can swim in
		LOCAL:9 += 100
	SIF GROUPMATCH(TIME:5, 4, 5, 6, 14) ;smaller handicap on top for rain, heavy rain, drizzle and rainstorm
		LOCAL:9 += 50
	SIF ABL:93:戦闘能力 >= 1 ;handicap scales with her combat level, no multiplying by 0 or negative numbers in this household
		LOCAL:9 = LOCAL:9 * ABL:93:戦闘能力
	;these numbers might be ridiculous at combat Ex, ought to test and rebalance
	HANDICAP_FIXED = 0
	HANDICAP_RAND = LOCAL:9
	;ハンデをつけることができ、数値が大きいほどあなたが不利になる　数値が負ならあなたが有利に
	;キャラの能力に関わらずクッソ強くしたり弱くしたりできる
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARGS == "戦闘前"
		PRINTFORML 「You wish to challenge me to a Danmaku duel, is that it?」
		IF K93_MAD()
			WAIT
			PRINTFORMW 「Fwuuuh... Something tells me that I shouldn't even entertain that idea.」
			PRINTFORMW 「And while I doubt this will make me feel any better, I shall still go with it.」
			PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% stops and takes a deep, long breath before speaking again.
			PRINTFORMW 「Just tell me when you're ready, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%.」
			RETURN 0
		ELSEIF FIRSTTIME("WaggyDanmakuDuel")
			WAIT
			PRINTFORML 「W-well, I haven't done one of those in a very long time now...」
			PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% shyly looks elsewhere, reminiscing about the past.
			PRINTFORMW 「You see, I'm not very fond of fighting over, even if it's just a friendly duel.」
			PRINTFORMDL %HE_SHE(93, 1)% shifts %HIS_HER(93, 0)% gaze towards you again.
			PRINTFORMW 「But it would be rude to deny you, so I accept it.」
			PRINTFORMW 「And besides, maybe it will end up being quite fun for me as well.」
		ELSE
			IF K93_LOVE_LUST_LOVER()
				PRINTFORML 「If it's you, I have no reasons to reject it.」
				PRINTFORMW 「After all, even "fighting" becomes enjoyable when it's done with you.」
			ELSEIF K93_YEARNING_SEXFRIEND(1)
				PRINTFORMW 「S-sure, I don't mind it at all...」
			ELSEIF K93_FRIENDSHIP()
				PRINTFORMW 「...I'm sure it can be a fun activity between friends.」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMW 「...Very well, I suppose I shall entertain you.」
			ENDIF
		ENDIF
		PRINTL
		IF K93_ISSWIM() && GROUPMATCH(TIME:5, 4, 5, 6, 14)
			PRINTFORMW 「Not only there is plenty of water for me to move around in, it's also raining.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Fwaaaah... I don't think it could get much better than this!」
			PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()% smiles as %HE_SHE(93, 0)% happily swims around in both water and rain.
			PRINTFORMDW It almost feels like %HE_SHE(93, 0)% is showing off before the fight.
		ELSEIF K93_ISSWIM()
			PRINTFORMW 「Good, there's more than enough water for me to move around freely here.」
			PRINTFORMW 「It would be a shame if I had to fight in a place without anywhere to swim in!」
			PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% goes for a short dive, resurfacing soon after with a smile.
		ELSEIF GROUPMATCH(TIME:5, 4, 5, 6, 14)
			PRINTFORMW 「No lakes and no rivers for me to move around here...」
			PRINTFORMW 「But that's okay, look! Rainwater works for swimming just fine!」
			PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()% suddenly starts to float and graciously fly in rain water.
			PRINTFORMDW Or rather, %HIS_HER(93, 0)% movements are better described as "swimming in the rain".
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW 「There is no water for me to swim in, and it isn't raining, either...」
			PRINTFORMW 「Fwuuuh... I can still do it, but don't expect much from me.」
			PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()% closes %HIS_HER(93, 0)% eyes and takes a deep breath, opening them again after a few seconds.
		ENDIF
		PRINTFORMW 「I'm ready when you are, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%.」
		RETURN 0
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;Handicap (doesn't show if the character's handicap is 0)
	;ハンデ
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARGS == "ハンデ"
		;No need to fill this out if character doesn't have handicap
		IF K93_ISSWIM() && GROUPMATCH(TIME:5, 4, 5, 6, 14)
			PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()% constantly alternates between swimming in water and flying in rain.
		ELSEIF K93_ISSWIM()
			PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()% swims around with speed, grace and agility.
		ELSEIF GROUPMATCH(TIME:5, 4, 5, 6, 14)
			PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()% swims around in rain with grace, just as %HE_SHE(93, 0)% would in a lake.
		ENDIF
		PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% seems to be more energetic than usual...
		[IF_DEBUG]
			PRINTFORMDW Current HANDICAP_RAND value is {HANDICAP_RAND}
		[ENDIF]
		RETURN 0
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;戦闘中TARGET被弾時口上
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARGS == "被弾"
		;別に一律で「やられたー」だけでもいいよ
		SELECTCASE 相手残機
		;CASE 3 ;only available to those with [Deep Knowledge of Life]
		CASE 2
			PRINTFORML 「That was a good hit. Good job, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%!」
			IF ABL:93:戦闘能力 >= 5
				PRINTFORMW 「Now, here is something that I have been practicing with...」
				PRINTL
				PRINTFORMDW ※Water Sign「Lunatic Red Slap」
				PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% shoots out a spiral of blue scales, followed by a tighter and more aggressive spiral of red scales.
				PRINTFORMDW The blue scales leave a lot of open space to pass through, despite their increased numbers.
				PRINTFORMDW However, the red scales grant no such mercy, as they are way more densely packed.
				PRINTFORMDW You might have a better chance of survival if you instead get closer and "surf" the red spiral instead.
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 「Are you ready? Here comes another one...」
				PRINTL
				PRINTFORMDW ※Water Sign「Tail Fin Slap」
				PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% shoots out spiral waves of many blue scales.
				PRINTFORMDW As they came closer, they leave a lot of open spaces for you to pass through.
				PRINTFORMDW Maybe you could even "surf" around the spirals as %HE_SHE(93, 0)% shoots them.
			ENDIF
		CASE 1
			PRINTFORML 「You're doing good, this is my last spell card.」
			IF ABL:93:戦闘能力 >= 5 && RAND:2
				PRINTFORMW 「It may seem impossible at first, but I guarantee you can dodge this one...」
				PRINTL
				PRINTFORMDW ※Tide Sign「Tidal Wave of the Lake」
				PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% sends waves of slow moving scales that break into chaotic shiny orbs when they get close.
				PRINTFORMDW At first sight, the scales are too tight together to be passed through.
				PRINTFORMDW But looking at it more closely, you notice quasi-invisible gaps you can squeeze by.
				PRINTFORMDW Otherwise, attempting to dodge and weave through the unpredictably patterned orbs might be a good idea.
			ELSEIF ABL:93:戦闘能力 >= 3
				PRINTFORMW 「This one may seem difficult, but I'm confident you can dodge it...」
				PRINTL
				PRINTFORMDW ※Scale Sign「Great Raging Waves of the Reversed Scale」
				PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% quickly shoots out multiple waves of many scales, colors blue, teal, green and purple.
				PRINTFORMDW Their amount is overwhelming, their pattern chaotic, and they very often overlap with each other.
				PRINTFORMDW Finding gaps you can pass through is difficult, but doable.
				PRINTFORMDW But the merciless pace they come towards you leaves almost no time for respite.
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMW 「Get ready and stay calm, you should be able to dodge this...」
				PRINTL
				PRINTFORMDW ※Scale Sign「Scale Wave」
				PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% sends out waves of green and blue scales in all directions, one after the other.
				PRINTFORMDW Although there are a lot of them and they often overlap, dodging them is very easy.
			ENDIF
		CASE 0
			IF K93_MAD()
				PRINTFORML 「Okay, that's enough of this for now.」
				PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% puts both of %HIS_HER(93, 0)% hands up.
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 「Okay, that's good enough, you got me!」
				PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% smiles as %HE_SHE(93, 0)% puts both hands up.
			ENDIF
		ENDSELECT
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;戦闘中
	;[Merciless] activates
	;waggy doesn't have this, so...
	;TARGETの【残忍酷薄】発動時
	;ARGはTARGETの残機
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 0
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARGS == "残忍酷薄"
		
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;戦闘中
	;[All-in] activates
	;Waggy doesn't have this either
	;TARGETの【乾坤一擲】発動時
	;ARGはTARGETの残機
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 0
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARGS == "乾坤一擲"
		
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;戦闘中
	;[DEADLY ANOMALIES, DANGEROUS MUTANTS, ANARCHISTS AND BANDITS]
	;I mean, [Anomalies, Strength, Disorder, and Spirits] activates
	;you guessed it, waggy doesn't get this
	;TARGETの【怪力乱神】発動時
	;ARGはTARGETの残機
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 0
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARGS == "怪力乱神"
		
	ENDIF
	
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;After the fight
	;The case statement is for the number of lives the character has remaining
	;戦闘後
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARGS == "戦闘後"
		PRINTL
		;Case 4 only applies to hus with【Deep Knowledge Of Life】
		;Cases 3-1 are for when you lose, Case 0 is for when you win
		;残り残機4が表示されうるのは【洽覧深識】持ちのみ
		;残機が1以上ならあなたの負け、0の場合はあなたの勝利
		IF K93_MAD()
			IF 相手残機 ;lose
				PRINTFORML 「Are you okay, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%?」
				PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% leans over you with a worried expression.
				PRINTFORMDL But once %HE_SHE(93, 0)% sees that you're unharmed, %HE_SHE(93, 0)% lets out a sigh.
				PRINTFORMW 「Fwuuuh... That's good, I would have hated if I hurt you with that.」
				PRINTFORMW 「I hope you had enough, and that you will go do something else.」
			ELSE ;win
				PRINTFORMW 「Are you happy with your victory, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%?」
				PRINTFORMW 「I hope you are, winning things is a good feeling...」
				PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% stops %HIM_HER(93, 0)%self and gives you a courteous nod.
				PRINTFORMW 「Now, If you don't need anything else, then please, I ask that you please leave me be.」
			ENDIF
			RESETCOLOR
			RETURN 1
		ENDIF
		
		IF FIRSTTIME("WaggyDDCAftermath", 0, 93) && K93_LOVE_LUST_LOVER()
			PRINTFORMDW After the fight, %K93NICK()% looks at the ground with %HIS_HER(93, 0)% chin resting on %HIS_HER(93, 0)% hand.
			PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% seems to be immersed in thought, so you decide to ask why.
			PRINTFORMW 「Hmmm? Oh, it's nothing, it's just that our fight reminded me of something.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Maybe you already know about it... but some time ago some docile youkai went on a little rampage.」
			PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% stops and takes a deep breath, before looking at you in the eye.
			PRINTFORMW 「...And that included me, going on about how youkai "should reaffirm the terror that we hold".」
			PRINTFORML 「Fufu, doesn't sound much like me that you know, does it?」
			PRINTFORMW 「That's because... I think we weren't really being ourselves, it was something else almost entirely.」
			PRINTFORMW 「And yet, at the same time, being tired of not being seen, and wanting to change that...」
			PRINTFORMDW %HE_SHE(93, 1)% trails off for a moment, %HIS_HER(93, 0)% expression becoming one of pain.
			PRINTFORMW 「It doesn't sound that far-fetched from what I want for myself, is the problem.」
			PRINTFORML 「And sometimes, I keep thinking about everything that happened, and I keep asking myself...」
			PRINTFORMW 「If maybe that's something that I should do to be seen, and no longer be ignored.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Of course the answer is no, but I still can't stop myself from thinking about it from time to time.」
			PRINTFORML 「But now that I have you giving me so much attention... I already got what I wanted, all along.」
			PRINTFORMDW A small yet bright smile begins to rise in %HIS_HER(93, 0)% lips.
			PRINTFORMW 「So thank you, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%. For being here for me, for listening me, and for looking at me like you do.」
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMW 「But that's enough of that, we should do something else together.」
			PRINTFORMW 「...Preferably, something that doesn't involve any dueling or competition.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Maybe some music would help us settle down, after all of that?」
			PRINTFORMW 「Do let me know if there's something you would do, and I will happily oblige.」
			RESETCOLOR
			RETURN 1
		ENDIF


		SELECTCASE 相手残機
		;CASE 4 ;no sir, doesn't have that one
		CASE 3 ;loss, not a single hit
			IF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 >= 5
				PRINTFORML 「%K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%, I hope you didn't go easy on me \@ TALENT:93:恋人 ? just because I'm your %PRINT_MALE("man", 93)% # out of pity \@.」
				PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% tilts %HIS_HER(93, 0)% head to the side with a faint frown on %HIS_HER(93, 0)% eyebrows.
				PRINTFORMW 「For someone as powerful as you to lose to me without even landing a single hit...」
				IF ABL:93:戦闘能力 >= 4
					PRINTFORML 「Although, maybe that means that I got a lot better at danmaku!」
					PRINTFORMDW %HIS_HER(93, 1)% lips curl into a bright smile.
				ELSE
					PRINTFORMW 「Somehow, I find that happening to be highly unlikely.」
				ENDIF
			ELSEIF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 >= ABL:93:戦闘能力
				PRINTFORMW 「D-did I really win? I wasn't expecting that at all...」
				PRINTFORML 「And to do it in such a flawless manner, too!」
				PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% grins as %HIS_HER(93, 0)% eyes sparkle with pride.
				PRINTFORMW 「Thank you %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%, that was strangely enjoyable.」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORML 「%K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%! I didn't hurt you, didn't I?」
				PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% leans over you with worry in %HIS_HER(93, 0)% eyes.
				PRINTFORMDW You shake your head, nothing seems to be broken and nothing seems to be bleeding.
				PRINTFORML 「That's good, I thought I had been a bit too harsh for a second.」
				PRINTFORMW 「For you to have lost against me like that, without landing a single hit...」
				PRINTFORMW 「Oh, I'm sorry, I didn't mean to put you down, I really got worried about you.」
				PRINTFORMW 「If anything, your spell cards were very pretty to look at!」
			ENDIF
		CASE 2
			PRINTFORML 「You fought well, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%.」
			PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% smiles as %HE_SHE(93, 0)% gives you a brief, courteous bow.
			PRINTFORMW 「I hope that was fun for you, even if you didn't win.」
			PRINTFORMW 「After all, isn't that the most important thing to do? To enjoy yourself?」
		CASE 1
			PRINTFORMDL %K93NICK()% closes %HIS_HER(93, 0)% eyes and takes a deep breath.
			PRINTFORMW 「Fwuuuh...That was a very close battle, wasn't it?」
			PRINTFORMW 「If you had hit me one more time, the outcome would have been very different.」
			PRINTFORMDL %HE_SHE(93, 1)% opens %HIS_HER(93, 0)% eyes again, this time with a faint smile on %HIS_HER(93, 0)% lips.
			PRINTFORMW 「But people like fighting and duels like these because of the thrill, am I correct?」
			PRINTFORMW 「Fufufu... Something like that feels a bit to stressful for me.」
			SIF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 >= 4
				PRINTFORMW 「Although, winning against someone as powerful as you feels strangely nice...」
		CASE 0 ;win
			PRINTFORML 「That was very well fought, %K93_HONORIFIC(MASTER)%!」
			PRINTFORMDW %K93NICK()% grins as %HE_SHE(93, 0)% congratulates you with a flurry of applause.
			IF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 >= 5
				PRINTFORMW 「Just as expected from someone as from someone as powerful as you.」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMW 「Your Danmaku was beautiful, it's clear that you have a lot of talent.」
			ENDIF
			PRINTFORMW 「And I must say that I had fun, even though I don't enjoy these kinds of things myself.」
		ENDSELECT
		PRINTL
		IF K93_LOVE_LUST_LOVER()
			PRINTFORML 「Now, how about we do the exact opposite of fighting?」
			PRINTFORMW 「I wouldn't mind spending some quality time with you after all of that～!」
		ELSEIF K93_YEARNING_SEXFRIEND(1)
			PRINTFORML 「N-now... is there anything else you would like to do?」
			PRINTFORMW 「I wouldn't mind helping you settle down, is that's what you wish.」
		ELSE
			PRINTFORML 「But with that out of the way, maybe you would like some tea to settle down?」
			PRINTFORMW 「If not that, just staying around and talking is fine, too.」
		ENDIF
	ENDIF
RESETCOLOR
ENDIF
RETURN 1

